MODULE: RetryAfterSiblingRetryWithoutCredit
TARGET: RetryAfterSibling
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a refused touch retries without a non-refused sibling completion
PERTURBS: GcPass
BOUNDS: LeafCount = 2

--- FIND
    /\ ~deleted /\ Eligible # {}
    /\ leadDone \/ Sweeps = {}
    /\ Cardinality(Sweeps) < Share
    /\ \E l \in Nearest :
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: refusal spins rather than waiting for the observed sibling return.
    /\ ~deleted /\ SpinEligible # {}
    /\ leadDone \/ Sweeps = {}
    /\ Cardinality(Sweeps) < Share
    /\ \E l \in SpinNearest :
--- FIND
Nearest == {l \in Eligible : \A q \in Eligible : rank[l] <= rank[q]}
--- REPLACE
Nearest == {l \in Eligible : \A q \in Eligible : rank[l] <= rank[q]}
SpinEligible == {l \in Leaves :
    /\ leaf[l].pin < head /\ leaf[l].drive = "none" /\ leaf[l].attempts < 2
    /\ (leaf[l].touch = "queued" \/
        (leaf[l].touch = "refused" /\ leaf[l].retries < 2))}
SpinNearest == {l \in SpinEligible : \A q \in SpinEligible : rank[l] <= rank[q]}
--- END
